						<quest>null</quest>
						<title>Practical Guide to Swordplay and Sauces</title>
						<descriptionFlavor>This tradebook establishes the author's authority on the subject of meals. It is a succinct digest of a complex subject.

According to the digest, Riku Porter's knowledge of fencing was so renowned that people would stop him in the street to question him about it. The outline says that, though these notes were made for Riku's personal use, they have been widely shared.

A masterpiece of the printer's art, this book shines and the pages are in amazing condition, as if never touched.</descriptionFlavor>
						<joyFactor>1</joyFactor>
						<description>&lt;color=#E6E64CFF&gt;Practical Guide to Swordplay and Sauces&lt;/color&gt; (legendary)

This tradebook establishes the author's authority on the subject of meals. It is a succinct digest of a complex subject.

According to the digest, Riku Porter's knowledge of fencing was so renowned that people would stop him in the street to question him about it. The outline says that, though these notes were made for Riku's personal use, they have been widely shared.

A masterpiece of the printer's art, this book shines and the pages are in amazing condition, as if never touched.

 - Melee: 312 XP / hour (max level 16)
 - Cooking: 312 XP / hour (max level 16)</description>
